{title: Gracias Por La Vida}
{artist: Sunny Davidson}

Great mystery thank you for this life
For the earth where we belong
The medicines to heal our hearts
The fire to guide us on
We sing/dance under the stars
The place where we come from
The mystery of this life unfolds
In the dance of the moon and sun

Chorus
Gracias por la vida
Y la medicina
Y el viaje del corazón
Gracias por el nuevo dia
Y el agua
Que es besada por el sol

Great mystery thank you for this love
For the way our hearts entwine
reflected in the water
Growing strong as a jungle vine
Even in the desert
Where the rain will hardly fall
This love just keeps on growing
building bridges instead of walls

Chorus

Great mystery thank you for this heart
For the beating of the drum
The children of this fire
The generations yet to come
We take our sacred seed
And we plant it on the earth
we water it with love
giving thanks for our rebirth

Chorus
